Intentional or not, this kind of change makes multiconduct pacifist
games winnable. Right now, there is a 12.81% chance Izchak does not
have enough candles. In vanilla, there is absolutely no way to make
candles without breaking a conduct (wishless, polypiles, pacifist),
and monsters cannot be created with them, either. So if your
multiconduct run doesn't find enough candles in mine town, the most
economical thing to do, in terms of player time, is to #quit and try
again.


